matics","M.Sc Mathematics","NET / SET or Applicable Eligibility","College Faculty / Assistant Professor","PhD","Research + Teaching","Professor / Senior Academic"]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility requirements can vary by institution and current regulations."},{"type":"h","text":"Teaching Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A serious mathematics teaching candidate should build evidence of teaching ability."},{"type":"h","text":"Lesson Plans"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare lessons covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Trigonometry"},{"text":"Coordinate geometry"},{"text":"Linear algebra"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Explanations"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Graphs"},{"text":"Dynamic geometry"},{"text":"Number lines"},{"text":"Function plots"},{"text":"Geometric diagrams"},{"text":"Interactive simulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Problem Banks"},{"type":"p","text":"Create questions at different levels:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conceptual","Basic Application","Multi-Step","Advanced Problem","Olympiad / Competitive Level"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Interactive Calculus Learning Toolkit"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop interactive demonstrations for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Limits"},{"text":"Derivatives"},{"text":"Integrals"},{"text":"Taylor series"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Use Python, Jupyter, GeoGebra or similar tools."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Mathematical Modelling Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a real-world problem such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Population growth"},{"text":"Traffic flow"},{"text":"Epidemic spread"},{"text":"Financial growth"},{"text":"Resource optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Assumptions"},{"text":"Mathematical model"},{"text":"Equations"},{"text":"Numerical solution"},{"text":"Visualization"},{"text":"Interpretation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Mathematics Learning Difficulty Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Study common student difficulties in a topic such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fractions"},{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Develop a diagnostic assessment and propose teaching interventions."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Computational Mathematics Toolkit"},{"type":"p","text":"Build Python-based modules for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equation solving"},{"text":"Matrix operations"},{"text":"Numerical integration"},{"text":"Root finding"},{"text":"Statistical calculations"},{"text":"Function visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Mathematical Visualization Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create interactive visualizations for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D geometry"},{"text":"Complex numbers"},{"text":"Fourier series"},{"text":"Probability distributions"},{"text":"Fractals"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"The objective should be mathematical understanding, not merely visual appearance."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Teaching experience should start before graduation."},{"type":"h","text":"Suitable Opportunities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"School teaching internships"},{"text":"Mathematics tutoring"},{"text":"Coaching institutes"},{"text":"STEM education organizations"},{"text":"Academic volunteering"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"Mathematics content development"},{"text":"Olympiad preparation organizations"},{"text":"University teaching/research assistantships"},{"text":"Mathematics outreach programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Progression"},{"type":"p","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["Peer Tutoring","Year 2"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Tutoring / Academic Volunteering","Year 3"]},{"type":"flow","items":["School / Coaching Internship","F